# Sourdough recipe – ingredients & steps.

title "Sourdough"
subtitle "Takes 24 hours. Worth every minute."

space

title "Ingredients"
list
    item
        text "500 g bread flour"
    item
        text "350 g water"
    item
        text "100 g active starter"
    item
        text "10 g salt"

space

title "Method"
list
    item
        text "Mix flour, water and starter. Rest 30 min."
    item
        text "Add salt. Stretch & fold every 30 min for 2 h."
    item
        text "Shape. Cold proof overnight."
    item
        text "Bake at 230 °C in a Dutch oven, lid on for 20 min."

button "Print this recipe" "#print"
